&lt;li&gt;Establish frameworks and governance models that ensure compliance requirements are consistently incorporated throughout the product lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create scalable approaches for managing legislative change, product readiness, and regulatory implementation across multiple countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Leadership to align compliance priorities with broader product strategy and business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives that improve compliance coverage, operational scalability, and customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Translate Regulatory Requirements into Product Solutions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the interpretation of complex payroll, employment, tax, and labor legislation across multiple jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure regulatory requirements are translated into clear business requirements, product specifications, and implementation guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Product Managers and Engineering teams in designing solutions that are compliant, scalable, and operationally effective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic direction on how legislative requirements should be operationalized within products and workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote consistency in how compliance requirements are assessed, documented, and implemented globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Drive Compliance-by-Design and Product Innovation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, and Payroll Operations leaders to embed compliance controls into product architecture and automation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for compliance-by-design principles that reduce manual intervention and operational risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to leverage technology, automation, and AI to improve compliance outcomes and customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of scalable product capabilities that simplify regulatory complexity for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence roadmap decisions by balancing regulatory requirements, customer needs, technical feasibility, and business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead Regulatory Intelligence and Market Readiness&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
